1. `Retry-After` as an HTTP date in the past retrying immediately (`source/core/Ky.ts:559-571`).
2. `Retry-After` larger than `retry.maxRetryAfter` clamped to `maxRetryAfter` (`source/core/Ky.ts:574`).
3. `RateLimit-Reset` used when `Retry-After` is missing (`source/core/Ky.ts:553-554`).

